ents, Larry Page and Sergey Brin. And they were ready to sell.", "start": 316.344, "end": 324.096, "spec": {"type": "beat", "scene": "exc", "els": [{"e": "obj", "k": "laptop", "x": 560, "y": 600, "w": 420, "at": 0, "out": [1, 0]}, {"e": "card", "x": 1340, "y": 330, "w": 640, "big": "Larry Page & Sergey Brin", "small": "founders of a tiny startup", "at": 0.3, "col": "ink", "out": [1, 0]}, {"e": "pill", "txt": "🏷️ for sale", "x": 1340, "y": 640, "size": 56, "at": 0.75, "bg": "red", "out": [1, 0]}]}, "afx": null, "words": [["Google", 0.087, 0.4], ["was", 0.4, 0.538], ["a", 0.537, 0.6], ["tiny", 0.6, 1.112], ["startup", 1.113, 1.613], ["run", 2.038, 2.3], ["by", 2.312, 2.487], ["two", 2.587, 2.913], ["Stanford", 2.913, 3.363], ["students", 3.362, 3.925], ["Larry", 4.15, 4.463], ["Page", 4.463, 4.963], ["and", 5.088, 5.2], ["Sergey", 5.213, 5.588], ["Brin", 5.588, 5.9], ["And", 6.312, 6.362], ["they", 6.362, 6.475], ["were", 6.487, 6.612], ["ready", 6.612, 6.812], ["to", 6.812, 6.875], ["sell", 6.888, 7.4]]}, {"text": "According to investor Vinod Khosla, the founders asked one million dollars. Excite's CEO, George Bell, said no.", "start": 324.576, "end": 333.072, "spec": {"type": "beat", "scene": "exc", "els": [{"e": "check", "x": 960, "y": 560, "w": 720, "to": "Google", "amt": "$1,000,000", "at": 0, "out": [1, 0]}, {"e": "stamp", "txt": "NO", "x": 1260, "y": 520, "at": 0.8, "col": "red", "sz": 90, "out": [1, 0]}]}, "afx": null, "words": [["According", 0.087, 0.438], ["to", 0.45, 0.562], ["investor", 0.562, 1.2], ["Vinod", 1.288, 1.8], ["Khosla", 1.812, 2.425], ["the", 2.675, 2.775], ["founders", 2.775, 3.35], ["asked", 3.362, 3.712], ["one", 3.725, 4.062], ["million", 4.075, 4.375], ["dollars", 4.388, 5.0], ["Excite's", 5.412, 5.737], ["CEO", 5.737, 6.337], ["George", 6.588, 6.938], ["Bell", 6.95, 7.275], ["said", 7.562, 7.812], ["no", 7.825, 8.113]]}, {"text": "So Khosla talked the price down. Seven hundred fifty thousand dollars.", "start": 333.552, "end": 338.208, "